      "proximity of player to nearest active NPC  (0=far, 1=right next to it)",
      "player health normalised                   (0–1)",
      "player in combat                           (0 or 1)",
      "current conversation turn count / 10       (soft-normalised)",
      "time in episode / 60                       (soft-normalised, max 1)",
      "conversation phase                         (0=idle, 0.33=initiated, 0.67=responded, 1=resolved)",
